00:37:54.760 --> 00:38:39.870
<v Liz Weil>By tonight at the dance, any reserve the farmer's had has pretty much faded away. There's more winking, more flirting, more moving of hips, less chat about seed corn around the edges of the room. When the "Macarena" cues up, Jim shakes his South Dakota booty with heartbreaking deliberateness and intent. Meanwhile, Kate, the tomboy with the eye for cowboy butts, remains in the back of the room. She spent most of her evening tangling with Rod, a tall, crazy-haired rancher who apparently does not like to dance. From 10:00 to 11:00, they pull and punch each other, get to know one another's bodies by yanking skirts and stealing hats. It's classic mating, junior high style. When they head out on the veranda, my producer and I follow.
<v Liz Weil>到今晚舞会时，农民们的所有矜持几乎都已经消散了。房间边缘少了一些关于种子玉米的聊天，多了更多的眨眼、调情、臀部摆动。当“玛卡莱娜”响起时，吉姆带着令人心碎的深思熟虑和意图摆动着他的南达科他屁股。与此同时，那个喜欢牛仔屁股的假小子凯特依然待在房间后面。她今晚大部分时间都在和罗德纠缠，罗德是一个高个子、头发乱糟糟的牧场主，显然不喜欢跳舞。从10点到11点，他们互相拉扯挥拳，通过拽裙子和抢帽子来熟悉彼此的身体。这是经典的求偶，初中风格。当他们走向阳台时，我的制作人和我跟了过去。

00:38:39.870 --> 00:38:41.360
<v Liz Weil>So how is your night going?
<v Liz Weil>那么你的夜晚过得怎么样？

00:38:41.360 --> 00:38:43.750
<v Kate>How's my night going? It's all right.
<v Kate>我的夜晚过得怎么样？还行。

00:38:43.750 --> 00:38:44.640
<v Liz Weil>Any excitement?
<v Liz Weil>有什么兴奋的事吗？

00:38:44.640 --> 00:38:51.240
<v Kate>[LAUGHTER] Any excitement, depends whose excitement we're talking about.
<v Kate>[笑声] 有什么兴奋的事吗，取决于我们在说谁的兴奋。

00:38:51.240 --> 00:38:51.640
<v Liz Weil>Yours.
<v Liz Weil>你的。

00:38:51.640 --> 00:38:53.570
<v Kate>Well, it's different.
<v Kate>嗯，这不一样。

00:38:53.570 --> 00:39:18.350
<v Liz Weil>Kate's been working on Rod since early this morning. They have similar ages, energy levels, goofy karmas. While Kate's been talking to us, Rod's been leaning on the railing, a couple of yards away. Just now, though, a tall brunette walks over and starts chatting him up. Kate doesn't move. She just gets quiet, and loses interest in our interview entirely.
<v Liz Weil>凯特从今天一大早就在纠缠罗德。他们年龄相仿，活力相当，有那种古怪的业力。当凯特和我们说话时，罗德正斜靠在几码外的栏杆上。然而，就在这时，一个高个子的黑发女人走过去开始和他搭讪。凯特没动。她只是安静下来，完全对我们的采访失去了兴趣。

00:39:18.350 --> 00:39:32.640
<v Kate>Listen, I can't [UNINTELLIGIBLE PHRASE]. I got to listen to this girl talk over here, because she's like, she's saying, you're the most handsome guy here. That's what she's telling him. I can sure see that. I mean, I don't have to look at people, but I can hear what the hell they're talking about. And when I hear my name mentioned, I perked up a little bit.
<v Kate>听着，我不能[无法辨认的短语]。我得听那个女孩在说什么，因为她像是，她说，你是这里最英俊的男人。她就是那么告诉他的。我肯定能看出来。我是说，我不必盯着人看，但我能听到他们在谈论什么鬼东西。当我听到我的名字被提到时，我振作了一点。

00:39:32.640 --> 00:39:33.890
<v Liz Weil>She's talking about you over there?
<v Liz Weil>她在说你吗？

00:39:33.890 --> 00:39:39.090
<v Kate>No, she's not talking. She's after that guy. I mean, I knew that. She was with us today.
<v Kate>不，她没在说。她在追那个家伙。我是说，我知道。她今天和我们在一起。

00:39:39.090 --> 00:39:45.100
<v Liz Weil>She's after Rod? That guy? She's after that guy?
<v Liz Weil>她在追罗德？那个家伙？她在追那个家伙？

00:39:45.100 --> 00:39:51.480
<v Kate>Shh. See, I can just stand over here and make like I'm talking to you guys, and I can hear everything.
<v Kate>嘘。看，我可以就站在一边装作在和你们说话，我什么都能听到。

00:39:51.480 --> 00:39:53.400
<v Liz Weil>Tell us what she's saying.
<v Liz Weil>告诉我们她在说什么。

00:39:53.400 --> 00:40:08.410
<v Kate>She says-- she said something about play into this. Listen. Oh, she's going back. She ain't going to talk to him anymore. I'm going to see-- Oh, he's not going back.
<v Kate>她说——她说了些关于参与其中的话。听。噢，她回去了。她不再和他说话了。我要看看——噢，他没回去。

00:40:08.410 --> 00:40:34.950
<v Liz Weil>Kate snags Rod, and the two of them walk back into the gazebo. It's clear that this is only a minor glitch. The dance ends at midnight. Kate and Rod hop in a cab and head downtown. We make for the hotel. Jim offers us a ride in his van, which he bought especially for SIA events, and which feels like a huge babe trap. The van is dark red and finely upholstered. Riding shotgun is Marie.
<v Liz Weil>凯特抓住了罗德，两人走回凉亭。很明显这只是个小插曲。舞会在午夜结束。凯特和罗德跳上一辆出租车往市中心去了。我们往酒店走。吉姆主动提出开他的面包车送我们，那是他特意为SIA活动买的，感觉就像是个巨大的诱饵。面包车是深红色的，内饰精美。坐在副驾驶的是玛丽。

00:40:34.950 --> 00:40:37.760
<v Sia Woman 8>We're going to the hospitality room.
<v Sia Woman 8>我们要去招待室。

