<v Marie>Yeah, let's go to my room and party.
<v Marie>是啊，我们去我房间聚会吧。

00:40:49.530 --> 00:40:57.010
<v Liz Weil>Major plans decided, the moment gets more personal. This is the time for putting on moves, to make something happen tonight.
<v Liz Weil>重大计划确定后，那一刻变得更加私密。这是施展招数的时候，为了今晚能发生点什么。

00:40:57.010 --> 00:41:02.690
<v Jim>This is my kind of music. What kind of music do you girls like?
